+/**
+ * Whether one accepted-socket peer address names the local loopback authority.
+ * `node:http` reports IPv4 as a dotted quad, IPv6 loopback as `::1`, and an
+ * IPv4-mapped peer as `::ffff:a.b.c.d`, so the mapped form is unwrapped before
